    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Покажи́ су́мки! Что ты берёшь?","gloss":"Show me the bags! What are you taking?"},{"by":"a","text":"Тёплые ве́щи, докуме́нты и де́ньги.","gloss":"Warm things, documents and money."},{"by":"b","text":"А все э́ти кни́ги?","gloss":"And all these books?"},{"by":"a","text":"Кни́ги оста́влю у бра́та.","gloss":"I'll leave the books at my brother's."},{"by":"b","text":"А друзе́й? Колле́г?","gloss":"And your friends? Your colleagues?"},{"by":"a","text":"Друзе́й не оставля́ют. Я бу́ду звони́ть!","gloss":"You don't leave friends behind. I'll call!"},{"by":"b","text":"Смотри́! А те фотогра́фии?","gloss":"Look! And those photos?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ой! Коне́чно, возьму́!","gloss":"Oh! Of course, I'll take them!"}] show_gloss false practice true size 1.5 hidden true
    text p1 "друзе́й · колле́г" say "друзе́й, колле́г" colors {"ей$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 540 font_size 58 hidden true
    text p1g "people" #8f887c x 500 y 475 font_size 30 hidden true
    text p2 "те фотогра́фии" say "те фотогра́фии" colors {"фотогра́фи[и]$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 360 font_size 58 hidden true
    text p2g "things" #8f887c x 500 y 295 font_size 30 hidden true
    text g1 "Я беру́ все тёпл[ые] ве́щ[и]." colors {"ве́щ[и]$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 560 font_size 60 hidden true
    text g2 "Я оставля́ю кни́г[и] и друз[е́й]." colors {"кни́г[и]$":"#3f7f4f","ей$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 560 font_size 60 hidden true
    icon q_case size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["briefcase"] icon_look picture of luggage hidden true
    icon q_friends size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["handshake","two men holding hands"] icon_look picture of "people holding hands" hidden true
    icon q_docs size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["memo","clipboard"] icon_look picture of "page facing up" hidden true
    text q4 "Я люблю́ кот[о́в] и кни́г[и]." colors {"ов$":"#1a8a8a","кни́г[и]$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 580 font_size 60 hidden true

A: Ско́ро я переезжа́ю в Петербу́рг, so tonight in (@draw s_tom@) London I'm packing.
    draw s_case s_to

A: Masha is on a video call, checking what goes in the bags.
    draw s_masha s_phone

    erase s_case s_to s_tom s_masha s_phone

A: Послу́шайте.
    draw ear

    ask "How many bags is he taking?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"Ты берёшь все тёплые ве́щи?","gloss":"Are you taking all the warm things?"},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Да. Беру́ то́лько чемода́н и э́ти две су́мки.","gloss":"Yes. I'm taking only the suitcase and these two bags."},{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"А докуме́нты? Де́ньги?","gloss":"And the documents? The money?"},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Всё в су́мке. А кни́ги оставля́ю, потому́ что у меня́ мно́го книг.","gloss":"It's all in the bag. But I'm leaving the books, because I have a lot of books."}] options ["one","two","three"] correct 2 transcript false reveal.text "две су́мки" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        right: Две су́мки: two bags.
        wrong: Э́ти две су́мки: these two bags.

    erase question_1_stamp

    ask "Where are the documents and the money?" listen same options ["at home","in the bag","with Masha"] correct 2 transcript false reveal.text "всё в су́мке" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        right: Всё в су́мке: it's all in the bag.
        wrong: Всё в су́мке: everything is in the bag.

    erase question_2_stamp

    ask "What does he have a lot of?" listen same options ["bags","books","money"] correct 2 transcript false reveal.text "мно́го книг" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        right: У меня́ мно́го книг: he has a lot of books.
        wrong: У меня́ мно́го книг: a lot of books.

A: Ещё раз, now with the words.
    erase question_3_stamp

    erase ear

B: Ты берёшь все тёплые ве́щи?
    draw n1

B: А докуме́нты? Де́ньги?
    draw n2

A: А кни́ги оставля́ю.
    draw n3

A: Посмотри́те: (@highlight n1 color #5b8c5a part ве́щи effect underline@) four objects, and (@highlight n2 color #5b8c5a effect underline@) every one in the (@highlight n3 color #5b8c5a part кни́ги effect underline@) plain plural, as if it were the subject.

A: Де́ньги, money, is always plural in Russian.
    draw n_money

    erase n1 n2 n3 n_money

A: So here is the plural object, the thing you take or leave or see.
    draw acc

A: Кни́гу, one book; кни́ги, many.
    draw acc_r1

A: Су́мку, су́мки. Докуме́нт, докуме́нты. Many things: no change at all.
    draw acc_r2 acc_r3

A: People are different. You know жду дру́га from lesson 55: alive takes the of-ending.
    draw acc_r4

A: In the plural too: дру́га, друзе́й.
    highlight acc_r4c3 part ей$ color #1a8a8a effect underline

A: Колле́га, a colleague: колле́гу, колле́г.
    draw acc_r5

A: No ending at all, and still the of-plural.
    highlight acc_r5c3 color #1a8a8a effect underline

A: Animals as well: кота́, кото́в.
    draw acc_r6

A: So for (@highlight acc_r1c3 acc_r2c3 acc_r3c3 color #3f7f4f effect underline@) many: things keep the plain plural, and (@highlight acc_r4c3 acc_r5c3 acc_r6c3 color #1a8a8a effect underline@) people and animals take the of-plural.

    erase acc

A: Все тёплые ве́щи: все, with е, is all of them.
    draw v1 v1g

A: Всё, with ё, is everything: всё в су́мке.
    draw v2 v2g

A: Э́ти су́мки, these bags, right here.
    draw d1 d1g

A: Те су́мки, those, over there.
    draw d2 d2g

A: And for one: тот чемода́н, та су́мка.
    draw d3 d3g

    erase v1 v1g v2 v2g d1 d1g d2 d2g d3 d3g

A: Брать, to take: беру́, берёшь.
    draw b1

A: Its one-time partner gives the future: я возьму́, I'll take.
    draw b2

A: Оставля́ть, to leave behind: я оставля́ю.
    draw b3

A: And its partner: я оста́влю, I'll leave it.
    draw b4

    erase b1 b2 b3 b4

A: Masha has more questions. Then tap Practise after (@draw tom_you@) the dialogue, and be Tom yourself.
    show tom tom_name masha masha_name masha_phone

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk_1 talk_2 talk_3 talk_4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name masha_phone tom_you

A: Друзе́й, колле́г: people, so the of-plural.
    draw p1 p1g

A: Те фотогра́фии: things, so the plain plural.
    draw p2 p2g

    erase p1 p1g p2 p2g

A: Now you. Things or people? Type the endings.
    draw g1

    ask "Запо́лните про́пуски." gaps g1

A: Я беру́ все тёплые ве́щи: things, the plain plural.
    highlight g1 part ве́щи color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase g1

A: Да́льше.
    draw g2

    ask "Запо́лните про́пуски." gaps g2

A: Я оставля́ю кни́ги и друзе́й: кни́ги, things; друзе́й, people.
    highlight g2 part ей$ color #1a8a8a effect underline

    erase g2

    draw q_friends

    quiz "Вы́берите. I see my friends: Я ви́жу ___." above q_friends reveal.text "Я ви́жу друзе́й." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Six questions now, then your score.
        right: Friends are people, so the of-plural: друзе́й.
        wrong: Many people take the of-plural: я ви́жу друзе́й.
        * дру́га
        + друзе́й
        * друг

    erase question_6_stamp q_friends

    draw q_docs

    quiz "Вы́берите. I'm taking the documents: Я беру́ ___." above q_docs reveal.text "Я беру́ докуме́нты." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Documents are things: the plain plural, докуме́нты.
        wrong: Things keep the plain plural: я беру́ докуме́нты.
        * докуме́нтов
        * докуме́нта
        + докуме́нты

    erase question_7_stamp q_docs

    icon q_bags size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 520 or ["shopping bags","purse"] icon_look picture of handbag

    quiz "Вы́берите. Not these bags, those: Не э́ти су́мки, а ___." above q_bags reveal.text "а те су́мки" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Су́мки is plural, so те.
        wrong: Тот and та are for one; for many, те.
        * тот
        + те
        * та

    erase question_8_stamp q_bags

    draw q4

    ask "Запо́лните про́пуски: I love cats and books." gaps q4 test t1

A: Я люблю́ кото́в и кни́ги: cats are alive, books are things.
    highlight q4 part ов$ color #1a8a8a effect underline

    erase q4

    draw q_case

    ask "Скажи́те: I'm taking only these two bags." also ["Беру́ то́лько э́ти две су́мки."] voice a show cue reveal.text "то́лько э́ти две су́мки" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 270 reveal.style label reveal.size 52 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        gloss: I'm taking only these two bags.
        say_it: Я беру́ то́лько э́ти две су́мки.

    erase q_case question_10_stamp

    ask "Напиши́те: I'm taking all these things." frame true answer ["я беру все эти вещи","беру все эти вещи","все эти вещи я беру","я возьму все эти вещи","возьму все эти вещи","все эти вещи я возьму"] reveal.text "Я беру́ все э́ти ве́щи." reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Пра́вильно! Все э́ти ве́щи: things, so the plain plural.
        wrong: Я беру́, then все э́ти ве́щи: я беру́ все э́ти ве́щи.

    erase question_11_stamp

    text e_th "things" #8f887c x 500 y 620 font_size 32
    text e_th1 "кни́ги · ве́щи · докуме́нты" say "кни́ги, ве́щи, докуме́нты" colors {"и$":"#3f7f4f","ы$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 555 font_size 50
    text e_pe "people · animals" #8f887c x 500 y 450 font_size 32
    text e_pe1 "друзе́й · колле́г · кото́в" say "друзе́й, колле́г, кото́в" colors {"ей$":"#1a8a8a","ов$":"#1a8a8a"} x 500 y 385 font_size 50

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 5

A: So: беру́ ве́щи и докуме́нты, the plain plural; оставля́ю друзе́й и колле́г, the of-plural, but only till I call.
    highlight e_th1 e_pe1 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase e_th e_th1 e_pe e_pe1

B: Молоде́ц! До встре́чи в Петербу́рге!
    icon end_masha size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "Молоде́ц! До встре́чи в Петербу́рге!" say "Молоде́ц! До встре́чи в Петербу́рге!" say_voice b x 500 y 270 font_size 50

